    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Visual Novel \u2022 Sci-Fi Thriller \u2022 Romance \u2022 Adult \u2022 Choices Matter</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mathew's college life takes a wild turn when his secret\u2014an AI-powered robot named Sasha\u2014draws government attention. After helping a friend avoid deportation, her provocative sister Camilla moves in, sparking chaos and desire.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As a covert agent infiltrates his circle, Mathew juggles seduction, secrets, and survival. Phones are hacked, identities exposed, and the group is forced into hiding\u2014planning to reverse-engineer the stolen tech and end the chase for good.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your choices shape everything:</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83d\udd25 <strong>FEATURES</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfad A branching narrative with <strong>multiple endings</strong>: Bad, Good... or Very Good?</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83e\udd16 A unique fusion of <strong>sci-fi espionage and adult romance</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udcac Dialogue-heavy gameplay with <strong>morally grey choices</strong> and <strong>dynamic character paths</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udf0d Explore themes of identity, surveillance, and rebellion\u2014all with a seductive twist</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udc9e High replay value: different paths lead to radically different outcomes</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfa7 Original soundtrack</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >NB from Developer: You don't need to play Reboot my Heart to understand Upgrade my Heart but we recommend it. Check the bundle with both games!</p></li></ul>",
